# Build output, if a kas/bitbake build tree is created inside the layer.
/build/
bitbake-cookerdaemon.log

# The pi user's home overlay (recipes-core/dogzilla-users/files/home-pi/) is
# installed verbatim into /home/pi, so anything dropped there ships in the
# image. Config worth sharing is tracked explicitly; the rest is local to one
# robot and must stay out of the repo:
#
#   .ssh/        personal authorized_keys -- your key, not everyone's
#   .local/      per-robot scripts and runtime state (fish history, etc.)
#   media/sound/ sound assets; the ones the demo uses are not ours to
#                redistribute, so they are fetched/generated locally
/recipes-core/dogzilla-users/files/home-pi/.ssh/
/recipes-core/dogzilla-users/files/home-pi/.local/
/recipes-core/dogzilla-users/files/home-pi/media/sound/*
!/recipes-core/dogzilla-users/files/home-pi/media/sound/player.qml
